    "note": "Batching is a general write-path win rather than an auth-specific fix: it is worth 29% with the flag off. It nearly halves the flag's relative cost, from +22% to +13.5%, but does not remove it -- the residue is the extra read and the larger statement, which batching amortises rather than eliminates."
